# The paper is what should be cited, not the software record — GitHub's "Cite
# this repository" button offers this entry first because of it.
preferred-citation:
  type: article
  title: >-
    TRINITY: A coupled model of winds, radiation, and photoionised gas in
    molecular clouds. I. Methods and validation
  authors:
    - given-names: Jia Wei
      family-names: Teh
    - given-names: Ralf S.
